    "innovation": "This paper identifies that model uncertainty in future Sahel precipitation is primarily driven by dynamic changes\u2014specifically, how different climate models simulate shifts in atmospheric circulation\u2014which are linked to uncertainties in projecting the Northern Hemisphere temperature gradient.",
