            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "It has been shown that a warming of the North Atlantic Ocean is associated with a northward shift of the Intertropical Convergence Zone over the tropical Atlantic Ocean and northern Africa (See for instance, Martin and Thorncroft 2014; Monerie et al. 2019).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
